        ("Celebrity PDF file named CEL-Ascent_FactSheet.pdf (not used in the table)", "https://creative.rccl.com/Sales/Celebrity/General_Info/Fact_sheets/CEL-Ascent_FactSheet.pdf"),
        ("Wikipedia: Celebrity Ascent", "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Celebrity_Ascent"),
